.DS_Store

# Vercel
.vercel

# EXPORTS. What the board-reading commands write — atlas renders, story exports, spec
# packets — goes here, and none of it is ever committed. (Replication snapshots and
# reports take an explicit path and live outside the repo; the patterns below still
# catch them if one is ever written at the repo root.) Board
# exports are DATA: large, private to somebody's project, and sometimes carrying
# internal infrastructure detail. A `git add -A` after a smoke run once put 49,258 lines
# of live board content into a branch; this directory exists so that cannot recur.
/exports/

# The old default output paths, still ignored so a stale checkout or an older build
# cannot reintroduce the same accident.
/atlas.json
/atlas.html
/exported-stories.md
/*.snapshot.json
/*.snapshot.json.apply-*.journal.jsonl
